    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HECTIC KITCHEN ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to put your culinary skills to the test?\u00a0 Open a bustling restaurant in the fast-paced, fun, and frantic\u00a0<strong>Diner Bros 2.\u00a0 </strong>Juggle orders, cook tasty meals, and race against the clock to satisfy your hungry customers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KNOW YOUR CUSTOMERS<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253150/extras/36d92adb0f21baa1797b0c02ee81d028.avif?t=1753370821\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Diner Bros 2</strong>, it's not just the orders that get crazy \u2014 it\u2019s also the <strong>Unique Customers</strong> who will keep you on your toes! Each character has their own quirks and demands that will test your multitasking skills:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No loitering! The <strong>Teenager</strong> thinks she can stay all day!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always on the move, the <strong>Jogger</strong> wants their food quickly - and we mean fast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the sneaky <strong>Punk</strong>\u00a0looking for an opportunity to dine and dash!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Kid</strong> only eats drumsticks - Annoying!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and many more! It's up to you to keep the orders flowing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR RESTAURANT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase New Equipment</strong>: as your diner grows, you'll need better tools to keep up with the increasing demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize Your Kitchen Layout</strong>: Efficiency is key when it comes to earning cash, so make sure your kitchen is set up for smooth operation.\u00a0 Or don't!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Restaurant</strong>: Can you impress the <strong>Food Critic</strong> and earn the coveted 3-star award?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253150/extras/b236d889a131e28c92cbbc44fa9b4572.avif?t=1753370821\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEED MORE STAFF? HIRE YOUR FRIENDS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Diner Bros 2</strong>, you don't have to do it alone\u00a0\u2014 hire servers to take some pressure off or <strong>Invite your Friends</strong> to join the chaos in full 4-player local co-op campaigns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook and Serve</strong> meals as fast as you can! Keep your customers happy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage and Expand Your Restaurant</strong>\u00a0for maximum efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get New Equipment and Learn New Recipes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Special Customers</strong> such as the Jogger, Teenager, Construction Worker, and Colonel... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...and Watch out for Dishonest Customers</strong> who will try to steal or eat for free!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow your Diner\u00a0</strong>in <strong>Burger Bros </strong>or<strong> Chicken Bros</strong>\u00a0(with\u00a0more to come!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire Staff</strong>\u00a0in the single-player or 2-player campaign\u2026</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026or ask your friends to help out in the<strong>\u00a0</strong>frantic  <strong>2-4 Player Couch Co-op </strong>experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253150/extras/caf1efb969b898ada4508b9090465c7e.avif?t=1753370821\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HECTIC KITCHEN ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to put your culinary skills to the test?\u00a0 Open a bustling restaurant in the fast-paced, fun, and frantic\u00a0<strong>Diner Bros 2.\u00a0 </strong>Juggle orders, cook tasty meals, and race against the clock to satisfy your hungry customers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KNOW YOUR CUSTOMERS<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253150/extras/36d92adb0f21baa1797b0c02ee81d028.avif?t=1753370821\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Diner Bros 2</strong>, it's not just the orders that get crazy \u2014 it\u2019s also the <strong>Unique Customers</strong> who will keep you on your toes! Each character has their own quirks and demands that will test your multitasking skills:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No loitering! The <strong>Teenager</strong> thinks she can stay all day!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always on the move, the <strong>Jogger</strong> wants their food quickly - and we mean fast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the sneaky <strong>Punk</strong>\u00a0looking for an opportunity to dine and dash!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Kid</strong> only eats drumsticks - Annoying!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and many more! It's up to you to keep the orders flowing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR RESTAURANT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase New Equipment</strong>: as your diner grows, you'll need better tools to keep up with the increasing demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize Your Kitchen Layout</strong>: Efficiency is key when it comes to earning cash, so make sure your kitchen is set up for smooth operation.\u00a0 Or don't!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Restaurant</strong>: Can you impress the <strong>Food Critic</strong> and earn the coveted 3-star award?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253150/extras/b236d889a131e28c92cbbc44fa9b4572.avif?t=1753370821\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEED MORE STAFF? HIRE YOUR FRIENDS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Diner Bros 2</strong>, you don't have to do it alone\u00a0\u2014 hire servers to take some pressure off or <strong>Invite your Friends</strong> to join the chaos in full 4-player local co-op campaigns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook and Serve</strong> meals as fast as you can! Keep your customers happy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage and Expand Your Restaurant</strong>\u00a0for maximum efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get New Equipment and Learn New Recipes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Special Customers</strong> such as the Jogger, Teenager, Construction Worker, and Colonel... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...and Watch out for Dishonest Customers</strong> who will try to steal or eat for free!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow your Diner\u00a0</strong>in <strong>Burger Bros </strong>or<strong> Chicken Bros</strong>\u00a0(with\u00a0more to come!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire Staff</strong>\u00a0in the single-player or 2-player campaign\u2026</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026or ask your friends to help out in the<strong>\u00a0</strong>frantic  <strong>2-4 Player Couch Co-op </strong>experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253150/extras/caf1efb969b898ada4508b9090465c7e.avif?t=1753370821\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The Diner Bros are back! With the same hectic cooking and serving, and now customization of your bustling restaurant! Serve quirky customers, earn cash to buy equipment, and discover new recipes in Diner Bros 2. Team up for 4 player local co-operative fun. No friends? Hire servers!",
